\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" after them, so a delivery sends what is still pending and completes. Events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked afterwards are dropped.","type":"text"}]}}}